
```mermaid
graph TB
    %% Input Sources
    Telegram[Telegram] -->|Messages| HermesGateway
    Voice[Voice Notes] -->|STT| SarvamSTT
    Web[Web Search] -->|SearXNG| SearchResults

    %% Core Processing
    HermesGateway -->|Profile| SteadCore[Stead Core]
    SarvamSTT -->|Transcript| SteadCore
    SearchResults -->|Proposals| SteadCore

    %% Storage Layer
    SteadCore -->|Read/Write| SQLite[(SQLite Store)]
    SQLite -->|Facts| FactsTable[facts table]
    SQLite -->|Tasks| TasksTable[tasks table]
    SQLite -->|Reminders| RemindersTable[reminders table]
    SQLite -->|Proposals| ProposalsTable[proposals table]

    %% Output
    SteadCore -->|Responses| Telegram
    SteadCore -->|Voice| EdgeTTS[Edge TTS]
    EdgeTTS -->|Voice| Telegram

    %% Styling
    classDef input fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef storage fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px

    class Telegram,Voice,Web input
    class HermesGateway,SteadCore,SarvamSTT,EdgeTTS process
    class SQLite,FactsTable,TasksTable,RemindersTable,ProposalsTable storage
    class Telegram,EdgeTTS output
```
